  "notes": [
    "गया / गई agrees with the speaker: a man says मैं जयपुर गया, a woman मैं जयपुर गई.",
    "With ने the verb agrees with the thing, not the person: मैंने शहर देखा, but मैंने फ़ोटो खींचीं. So देखा and खाया are the same for a man and a woman.",
    "कैसी रही? (\"how did it stay?\") asks how something went. ट्रिप is feminine, so कैसी.",
    "मज़ा आया (\"fun came\") means \"I enjoyed it\"."
  ]
